  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twese hamwe mu kwimakaza ubuzima bw&apos;imyororokere kuri bose/Together for ensuring sexual and reproductive health and rights for all&#xbf;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims at improving universal coverage for SRHR of adolescent girls, with a focus on preventing teenage pregnancies, and an enhanced assistance to SGBV victims, with an effort on promoting behavioural transformation towards the eradication of SGBV in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
